  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[Cadd9]Watching, [Bb/C]waiting,\n[C]rising, [D/C]falling,\n[C]Listening, [Bb/C]calling,\n[C]drifting. [Bb/C]\n[Cadd9]Touching, [Bb/C]feeling,\n[C]seeing, [D/C]belieing,\n[C]Hoping, [Bb/C]sending,\n[C]leaving. [Bb/C]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm7]I couldn't say why you and\n[Em7]I are Gemeni If i\n[Eb]tried to write a million words a day\n[Dm7]I\n[Cadd9]see your [Bb/C]shadow\n[C]coming [D/C]closer Then\n[C]watch you [Bb/C]drifting away\n[C]  [Bb/C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Cadd9]Watching, [Bb/C]waiting,\n[C]rising, [D/C]falling,\n[C]Listening, [Bb/C]calling,\n[C]drifting. [Bb/C]\n[Cadd9]Touching, [Bb/C]feeling,\n[C]seeing, [D/C]belieing,\n[C]Hoping, [Bb/C]sending,\n[C]leaving. [Bb/C]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm7]I couldn't say why you and\n[Em7]I are Gemeni We are\n[Eb]traveling a million worlds away\n[Dm7]I\n[Cadd9]see your [Bb/C]shadow\n[C]coming [D/C]closer Then\n[C]watch you [Bb/C]drifting away\n[C]  [Bb/C]\n\n[Outro]\n[Cadd9]Watch you [Bb/C]drifting away\n[C]  [D/C]\n[Cm7]  [F/C]\n[Cm7add11]",
